          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sudden nausea from approximately 3 am today, followed by 4 episodes of non-bloody, non-bilious vomiting and 3 episodes of watery brown diarrhoea over approximately 24 hours. Last vomit approximately 5 hours ago. No blood or mucus reported."
